      "description": "工具面板中的默认执行操作；最小高度而非高度上限。Source: Button.tsx, accents.css, ToolInspector.css, Mantine styles.css.",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-primary\">处理文件</button>",
      "css": ".ds-primary{font-family:inherit;font-size:0.8125rem;font-weight:500;line-height:1.4;min-height:2.5rem;height:auto;padding:0 1.125rem;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:0.75rem;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.2s ease;white-space:normal;background:var(--c-btn-solid);color:var(--c-btn-inverse);border-color:transparent;}.ds-primary:hover:not(:disabled){background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--c-btn-solid) 85%, var(--c-btn-inverse));}.ds-primary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--c-primary);outline-offset:0.125rem;}.ds-primary:active:not(:disabled){transform:translateY(0.0625rem);}.ds-primary:disabled{background:var(--mantine-color-disabled);color:var(--mantine-color-disabled-color);border-color:transparent;cursor:not-allowed;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tool Secondary Button",
