      "refersTo": "button-tertiary",
      "description": "透明底的较轻辅助动作。Source: Button.tsx, accents.css, ToolInspector.css.",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-tertiary\">返回设置</button>",
      "css": ".ds-tertiary{font-family:inherit;font-size:0.8125rem;font-weight:500;line-height:1.4;min-height:2.5rem;height:auto;padding:0 1.125rem;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:0.75rem;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.2s ease;white-space:normal;background:transparent;color:var(--c-text);border-color:transparent;}.ds-tertiary:hover:not(:disabled){background:var(--c-hover);}.ds-tertiary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--c-primary);outline-offset:0.125rem;}.ds-tertiary:active:not(:disabled){transform:translateY(0.0625rem);}.ds-tertiary:disabled{background:var(--mantine-color-disabled);color:var(--mantine-color-disabled-color);border-color:transparent;cursor:not-allowed;}"
