      "description": "保留原顶部同级入口的当前、悬停与焦点状态。Source: AppNavigationBar.css.",
      "html": "<nav aria-label=\"主要入口\" class=\"ds-nav\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-nav-view\">我的文件</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-nav-view\" aria-current=\"page\">编辑器</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-nav-view\">工具库</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;gap:0.25rem;padding:0.1875rem;border-radius:var(--radius-lg);background:var(--c-bg);}.ds-nav-view{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:0.5rem;min-height:2.25rem;padding:0.375rem 1rem;border:0;border-radius:var(--radius-md);font-family:inherit;font-size:0.875rem;font-weight:var(--font-weight-medium);background:transparent;color:var(--c-text-muted);white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color var(--motion-fast),color var(--motion-fast);}.ds-nav-view:hover{background:var(--c-hover);color:var(--c-text);}.ds-nav-view[aria-current=\"page\"]{background:var(--c-primary-subtle);color:var(--c-text);}.ds-nav-view:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--c-primary);outline-offset:2px;}.ds-nav-view:disabled{opacity:0.5;cursor:not-allowed;}"
    },
